{
  "run_id": "PMC11077685__broad__decide_then_ground_v2_o3mini__s1",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is to add 5–10 at% Al to the refractory high-entropy alloy.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding 5–10 at% Al will promote formation of a protective oxide scale.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective scale produced by Al addition will be Al2O3.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al2O3 scale will be continuous, slow-growing, and adherent.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al has a high affinity for oxygen.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al will preferentially oxidize in the modified alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting alumina scale will act as a barrier to further oxygen ingress.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blocking oxygen ingress will mitigate rapid oxidation of the alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-modified alloy will have roughly an order-of-magnitude lower mass gain than the untreated alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The predicted improvement will occur at approximately 1200 °C in air during a 100-hour exposure.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The untreated refractory high-entropy alloy forms non-protective or rapidly growing scales that permit high oxygen ingress and degradation.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The benefit may change substantially with temperature, oxygen partial pressure, or exposure duration.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The magnitude of the improvement and the alumina-scale microstructure may depend on the alloy's overall composition and processing history.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mass gain per unit area is proposed as the measure of oxidation response.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.measurements",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Failure to form a continuous protective alumina scale together with failure to achieve roughly an order-of-magnitude reduction in mass gain would falsify the hypothesis.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.falsification_rule",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    }
